orce is actually comprised of two  symbiotic parts the cosmic force and the  living force and the living force is  what lives in every single living being  in the galaxy and it's this energy field  that the jedi and sith manipulate for  their own purposes like it is the  invisible energy of life itself that is  given to all four sensitives regardless  of religious affiliation through the  little microscopic sentient and  intelligent organisms that live in the  cells of every living being throughout  the galaxy called midichlorians now look  i know some of you out there really  don't like the concept of midi-chlorians  but whether you like it or not  midichlorians are actually central to  the entire star wars mythos because like  qui-gon jin said they are responsible  for life itself giving life the energy  it needs to survive and like qui-gon  jinn tells yoda in clone wars  midi-chlorians themselves are born from  the other complementary side of the  force the cosmic force the part of the  force that all living beings in star  wars go when they die and a place that  exists outside of space and time that  binds the universe together so basically  everything that lives eventually dies  and goes into the cosmic force and then  the cosmic force influences the  midichlorians and the midichlorians  create life in the universe basically  like a yin yang situation the living  force flows into the cosmic force and  the cosmic force goes back into the  living force and the cosmic force is  extremely important to star wars because  this is where the will of the force  lives like this is what becoming one  with the force means after you die it's  becoming one with the cosmos and when  your living force energy becomes one  with the cosmic force along with every  other being that has ever died your  living force energy now goes into the  cosmic force helping the cosmos  manipulate the destinies of all the  living people according to the cosmos's  own plan for the universe and star wars  tends to call this cosmic plan for the  universe the will of the force like in  pretty much every piece of star wars  media you hear that the destiny of the  galaxy is guided by the will of the  force and you see that the jedi are  constantly meditating to try to get some  type of magical insight from the cosmos  about what is happening in the galaxy  this is the cosmic force speaking to the  jedi with and this is very important the  help of those very helpful living force  midichlorians in their blood translating  what the cosmic force is saying like  remember that moment from the end of the  rise of skywalker when rey hears all the  voices of the past jedi giving her  encouragement as she stares off into the  stars those jedi died and were one with  the cosmic force and were using rey's  living force midichlorians to produce  the sounds within rey so that rey could  hear them like midichlorians are the  bridge between the dead and the living  and also the bridge between the force  user and the force in general because  the midichlorians give users force  powers so this being said when qui-gon  jinn died in the phantom menace his life  energy that was tied to the living force  transferred over to the cosmic force and  since afterlife force ghost energies of  the cosmic force can only communicate  through living force midichlorians if  one severs one connection to the living  through years of isolation on tatooine  losing all their hope in people more and  more by the day your connection to the  living force midichlorians is going to  be weak as hell because your connection  to the living is non-existent like it  was only through meeting leia and luke  that obi-wan was able to fully restore  his connection to the living force  because princess leia reminded obi-wan  of the value of connecting with the  living and it wasn't until obi-wan freed  himself for being so preoccupied  with thinking about the betrayal of his  dead padawan failure anakin skywalker  and learned that the living can not only  be trusted but also inspire a new hope  for the future that obi-wan was able to  reconnect with the living force  midichlorians within his body which  allowed him to see his old master  qui-gon jinn this is what the main  importance of obi-wan breaking out of  his rocky vader tomb in the finale was  his experience with princess leia gave  him hope for the living and the hope for  life in general and that specific  reawakened connection to life allowed  obi-wan to use his living force  midichlorians to the absolute best of  his abilities which is why we have never  seen obi-wan kenobi so damn strong in  the force before like he lifted so many  rocks and he threw him out darth vader  and vader couldn't do [ __ ] like leia's  love was like rocket fuel for obi-wan's  midi-chlorians and they just ate that  [ __ ] right up so yeah qui-gon jinn was  right he didn't go anywhere qui-gon now  being one with the cosmic force was now  everywhere and always with obi-wan it  was obi-wan himself that needed to  change his receptiveness to the living  in order to restore his connection to  the living force via his living force  midichlorians and it is through the  living force that you can see cosmic  force ghosts like qui-gon jinn and be  attuned to the will of the force in  general but that is why i believe  obi-wan kenobi could not see qui-gon jin  until the very last moment of the finale  but what do you guys think of the finale  in general let us know in the comment  section below and of course you gotta  let us know what you guys think of the  finale because like my god i'm still  thinking about that days later but yeah  thank you guys so much for watching this  video you can follow me mastertainment  on twitter if you want to see me tweet  some weird [ __ ] and some really fun  theories but more importantly you can  follow new rockstars wherever we are on  social media make sure you hit that  notification bell on youtube you can get  n